  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên tam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tam giác đều, suy ra <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>, cho nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>,</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mover><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">̂</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>60</mn><mo>∘</mo></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTam giác <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>B</mi></semantics></math> nên <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t\tTa có <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>⋅</mo><mover><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mro